Package: flatratemath
Type: Package
Title: Benchmark Math for Flat-Rate Software Subscriptions
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("James", "Verlander", email = "scrapertweeter3+cran@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Maintainer: James Verlander <scrapertweeter3+cran@gmail.com>
Description: Benchmarks an unlimited-request flat-rate software
    development subscription against the fully loaded monthly cost of a
    senior US software engineer. Computes annual savings and coverage
    multiples at the built-in Poket Dev rates or at any salary and flat
    rate you supply, converts salaries with benefits, payroll tax,
    bonus, and retirement match into fully loaded monthly costs,
    projects cumulative savings by month, and derives effective hourly
    rates for both cost models. Pure arithmetic, no dependencies,
    suitable for pricing pages and procurement math.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://www.poketdev.com
BugReports: https://github.com/scrapertweeter3-prog/flatratemath-r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
NeedsCompilation: no
